            "review_title": "Review at La Côte d'Azur",
            "review_text": "14raj\n661 contributions\n0\nBreakfast included\nJun 2018 • Family\nWe had breakfast here. Finding restaurants can be a bit of a bear. The maps don't seem to match the layout well. So, you throw them away and ask your way for help from Vietnamese staff who understand English.\nAt breakfast, the restaurant was agof with tourist flow. The buffet is segmented into European, Chinese and Vietnamese items. They are a decent selection. Refills and waitstaff are a bit hard to come by. The restaurant was at best 60% loaded.\nThere was no view of the Riviera 😋.\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2019",
